#: Game.Levels.RelationWorld.L01_Cartesianproducts
msgid "As a tutorial for how to work with Cartesian products of sets in Lean, we will verify what it means for §0 to **not** be in a Cartesian product. We'll assume we have sets §1 and §2 coming from a universe §3.\n"
"\n"
"The terms §4 and §5 showing up in the goal are how Lean denotes the first and second coordinates of §6."
msgstr ""

#. §0: $$¬ (P ∨ Q) ↔ (¬ P ∧ ¬ Q)$$
#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.EquivWorld_eg.L01_equiv
msgid "This is half of **DeMorgan's Law**. It says that\n"
"\n"
"§0"
